        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 4214, Hercules Smooth Grip Entry Door Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Hercules Smooth Grip Handleset is available in single cylinder and dummy functions. This modern handleset will fit either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and can accommodate doors from 1-3/4 inches to 3 inches thick. The Hercules Entry Door Handleset features the clean lines that have become synonymous with contemporary home decor. A two piece handleset, it has a separated deadbolt plate. This front door handle has many sleek interior trim styles to choose from including levers, knobs, and crystal knobs. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for the Hercules Tubular Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li> \r\n<li>UL 180 minute fire rating</li>\r\n<li>Hardened steel bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Emtek Hercules Entrance Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Plate Height: 2-1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Bottom Plate Height: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Bottom Plate Width: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Clearance: 1-7/8”</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Thickness: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Deadbolt Plate Height: 2-1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Plate Height: 2-1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 3\" please specify</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Distance between Latch Bore to Bottom Mounting Hole: 8-5/8\" c.c.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-4214-specifications.pdf?v=1774586585\"><b>Emtek 4214 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-Handle-B-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262345\"><b>Emtek Tubular Entryset Template Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob/lever operates the latch.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-levers-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354533\" width=\"599\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Hercules Sectional Handleset",
                "description": "The Hercules Handleset is available in single cylinder and dummy functions. This modern handleset will fit either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and can accommodate doors from 1-3/4 inches to 3 inches thick. The Hercules Entry Door Handleset features the clean lines that have become synonymous with contemporary home decor. A two piece handleset, it has a separated deadbolt plate. This front door handle has many sleek interior trim styles to choose from including levers, knobs, and crystal knobs.",
                "keywords": "Hercules Handlesets, Modern Hercules Entry Door Handlesets, Emtek 4214, Emtek 4204, EMT-4214, Hercules Entry Door Handlesets, Hercules Tubular Handlesets, Emtek Hercules Entrance Handlesets, modern front door locks, modern front door handles, two piece handlesets,"
            },
